  "body": "See also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3821, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3699.\r\n\r\nTestcase:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<div id=\"host\"></div>\r\n<script>\r\nhost.attachShadow({ mode: \"open\" }).innerHTML = `\r\n<style>\r\n  div:lang(en) {\r\n    width: 100px;\r\n    height: 100px;\r\n    background-color: green;\r\n  }\r\n</style>\r\n<div></div>\r\n`;\r\n</script>\r\n```",
